WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:04,980
Otherwise, let's find another way

2
00:00:04,980 --> 00:00:08,380
It's too risky eh

3
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:09,980
She said she could broadcast in the radio room

4
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:10,980
Lure those lunatics away

5
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:12,580
She also has a car parked nearby.

6
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:13,780
He also said that he has a house and money

7
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:15,580
If we can't take her with her when she goes out, we'll just let her out.

8
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:16,980
We can just drive out

9
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:18,380
Since she can lure away the madman

10
00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:20,180
Why don't you escape on your own?

11
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:23,460
She said she was pretending

12
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:25,660
I drove specially to the administrative building for a meeting.

13
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:27,660
When the meeting ended, someone mutated

14
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:29,460
She ran downstairs and was pushed down

15
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:32,350
Hiding in the broadcast room in the chaos

16
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:34,350
The guy who pushed her turned crazy

17
00:00:34,350 --> 00:00:36,150
He's leading a group of lunatics to knock on the door.

18
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:37,950
Ask her how long she can last

19
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:41,330
She said the door was strong

20
00:00:41,330 --> 00:00:42,330
How many days can it last?

21
00:00:42,330 --> 00:00:43,530
Madman got bored

22
00:00:43,530 --> 00:00:44,930
Just go find someone else

23
00:00:44,930 --> 00:00:47,980
Isn't that the monster's blood?

24
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:48,980
How do we get there?

25
00:00:48,980 --> 00:01:04,340
Fly over? Xiaolin, please calm down.
